<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Balance Druids</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not a true "best in slot" list, but instead more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in order to determine their best combination of stats and effects.<br/>
<br/>
